1
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,640
You just said

2
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,930
you have a way to help me find the Liangshan assassin.

3
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,960
Tell me more about it.

4
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,039
Miss.

5
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,600
Bad news, Miss.

6
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,280
The Imperial City Department has surrounded the Zhao residence.

7
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,600
There are guards at both the front and back doors.

8
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,800
It's a huge formation.

9
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:25,360
What?

10
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,360
They must have tracked me down

11
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,640
and implicated the Zhao family.

12
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,840
Don't panic, sister.

13
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,020
The Zhao Manor,

14
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,180
no matter how fallen it is,

15
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,479
won't allow the Huangchengsi to easily break in with troops,

16
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:40,280
let alone search this backyard.

17
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,289
Don't worry, everyone.

18
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,640
Zhu'er,

19
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,660
come with me to take a look.

20
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:53,039
The Huangchengsi has received a report

21
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,960
that the Zhao Manor is hiding a rebel.

22
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,680
If you do not hand them over voluntarily,

23
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,410
we will immediately attack and search the manor.

24
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,000
I wonder

25
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,720
which official from the Capital Security Office you are.

26
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,680
Please show the search warrant.

27
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,960
Deputy Commander of the Capital Security Office,

28
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,800
Cui Hong.

29
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:17,160
By Chancellor Cai's verbal order,

30
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,760
I am here to arrest the rebel Chu Sanniang.

31
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,680
If you obstruct me again,

32
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,960
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

33
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,640
My Zhao family

34
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:30,320
may not have been involved in politics in the capital for years.

35
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:32,180
However, my uncle Zhao Mingcheng

36
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,840
has received an edict to return to service,

37
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,370
and is heading to Dongjing.

38
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,320
He will soon

39
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,250
take up his post.

40
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,160
My aunt, Li Qingzhao,

41
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,920
is highly talented

42
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,880
and greatly appreciated by His Majesty.

43
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:46,680
Her fame is renowned in court and among the people,

44
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:50,440
often discussing poetry with Madam Li and His Majesty.

45
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,600
Let me ask you,

46
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,820
can you bear the consequences

47
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,360
of trespassing on our estate,

48
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,480
Lord Cui?

49
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,040
Miss Zhao,

50
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,840
don't push your luck.

51
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,840
The rebel Chu Sanniang entered the Zhao estate through the back door.

52
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,360
The evidence is conclusive.

53
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,160
I am acting according to the law.

54
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,640
Even if the superiors find out,

55
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,820
I have nothing to fear.

56
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,640
Then, My Lord,

57
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,640
you can try.

58
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,360
What a stubborn and fierce young lady.

59
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,640
I won't barge in.

60
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,440
But ask the rebel Chu Sanniang

61
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:40,760
to come out and surrender obediently.

62
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:48,920
Lord Chu,

63
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,520
if you don't show yourself,

64
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,370
don't blame me for not saving you face.

65
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,210
How dare you!

66
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,400
This young lady has no official rank.

67
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,880
For obstructing the Imperial City Bureau,

68
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,680
even if I shoot her dead,

69
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,760
I am acting according to the law.

70
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,600
Commander,

71
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,920
think carefully.

72
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,040
My Lord,

73
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,120
don't be impulsive.

74
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,580
Put the big picture first.

75
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,320
Lord Chu,

76
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,880
I'll count to three.

77
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,880
If you don't come out,

78
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,680
I will shoot.

79
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,120
My lord.

80
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:34,960
How dare you!

81
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,200
Lord Cui.

82
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:55,360
I didn't know you were coming, Inspector Zhou.

83
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,760
Forgive me for not welcoming you properly.

84
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,130
Inside this sedan chair

85
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,520
is Li Yi'an,

86
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,140
the Householder of Yi'an.

87
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,080
His Majesty ordered me

88
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,800
to specially escort Householder Li

89
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,080
to the Zhao residence.

90
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,640
How dare you make trouble here?

91
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:10,840
My lord.

92
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,240
Please don't be impulsive, my lord.

93
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,360
Calm down, Madam Chu.

94
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,360
Lord Zhou You

95
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,600
has escorted Householder Li back.

96
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,520
It's all right now.

97
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,560
I was reckless

98
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,160
and offended Householder Li

99
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,890
and offended

100
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,970
Inspector Zhou.

101
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,480
Then get out of here!

102
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,280
Go.

103
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,520
Aunt.

104
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,280
Han.

105
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,800
About His Majesty's arranged marriage,

106
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,880
I know.

107
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,080
Your uncle has wronged you.

108
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:05,000
Please don't say that, Aunt.

109
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
I know I have been ill for a long time.

110
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:08,440
Now,

111
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,520
with this sick body,

112
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:13,540
if I can still help Uncle and the Zhao family,

113
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,480
it is my blessing.

114
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:18,680
You shouldn't stay at the Zhao family for too long.

115
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,240
During the Lantern Festival,

116
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,400
you can accompany me

117
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,600
to Fanlou

118
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,360
to relax.

119
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,680
Aunt,

120
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:28,040
do you have another appointment with Madam Li?

121
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,920
Shishi has composed a new tune

122
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,080
for Rumengling.

123
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:36,640
She will present it to His Majesty on the night of the festival.

124
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,480
Before that,

125
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:40,090
she invited me to appreciate it first.

126
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,680
Han'er's talent

127
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,159
is also outstanding.

128
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,920
So come along with your aunt.

129
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,400
Yes.

130
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:50,220
Sister, come here.

131
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,640
This is His Majesty's handwriting.

132
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,930
This is my handwriting.

133
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,760
If I hadn't seen you write it yourself,

134
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:19,490
I would have thought I wrote it.

135
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,040
Since the thief framed you with a letter,

136
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,520
why don't we give him a taste

137
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,040
of his own medicine?

138
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,880
Sister,

139
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:30,480
just let me see Liang Shicheng's handwriting.

140
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,090
That's not hard.

141
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,080
After dark,

142
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:36,080
I'll sneak into Liang Shicheng's mansion

143
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,520
and get a piece of his handwriting.

144
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,720
Rather than you risking stealing the letter, sister,

145
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,560
it's better

146
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,600
to seek Zhou You's help.

147
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,840
Zhou You is in the Palace Domestic Service.

148
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,120
It would be easier for him to get Liang Shicheng's handwriting

149
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,120
than for you to act rashly.

150
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:50,960
Besides,

151
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:53,680
we can use this to test his intentions.

152
00:07:57,159 --> 00:07:58,040
Brother Meng.

153
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,660
How to find that Liangshan assassin,

154
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,080
please tell us in detail.

155
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,080
The mission Liangshan received

156
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,410
was to ruin the Knife Peddlers' business.

157
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,000
And the Knife Peddlers' business

158
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,480
is on the Bian River,

159
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,120
using modified merchant ships

160
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,240
to secretly transport smuggled salt and women for profit.

161
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,400
The latest ship.

162
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,360
It will arrive tonight at the hour of Xu

163
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,520
at Xishuimen Pier.

164
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,000
After the ship docks,

165
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,840
the smuggled salt and women

166
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,200
will be gathered at

167
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,520
the nearest tavern to the pier,

168
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,520
Yunxiang Tavern.

169
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:29,520
Liangshan only needs to expose this illegal trade

170
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,200
to complete the mission.

171
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,400
What will they do then?

172
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,480
These people from Liangshan are in Tokyo for the first time.

173
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,159
They are unfamiliar with the place.

174
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,440
But they have manpower,

175
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,640
so it is highly likely

176
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,600
that they will try to destroy the ships directly.

177
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,680
According to the request of the Master of Wuyou Cave,

178
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:48,200
the illegal trade must be exposed and blown out of proportion.

179
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:50,440
But the patrols on the Bian River are very strict.

180
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,440
If the navy controls the information on the ships

181
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,880
and prevents it from spreading,

182
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,200
then even if Liangshan destroys the ships,

183
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,240
they won't have completed the mission.

184
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,720
There is only one way left.

185
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,660
Attack Yunxiang Pavilion directly.

186
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,340
Based on what you said,

187
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,890
as long as we guard Yunxiang Pavilion,

188
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,730
we can ambush and capture them.

189
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,160
Meng,

190
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,410
do you still have any concerns?

191
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:21,680
The Master of Wuyou Cave wants to ruin the business of the Knife Lender.

192
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,410
Even if it's for his own profit,

193
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,040
it's a great deed

194
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,900
for the common people.

195
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,360
Meng,

196
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:29,960
do you want to

197
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,160
help Liangshan

198
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,770
complete this mission?

199
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:38,200
Catching the thieves and getting rid of the evil for the people at the same time.

200
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,760
Isn't it the best of both worlds?

201
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,360
Then,

202
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,320
what do you want to do?

203
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,780
We'll do as the Master of Wuyou Cave said,

204
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,680
and expose the Knife Lender's shady deals.
